# FHIN FARM agent — Cloudflare Worker configuration.
#
# Non-secret values live in wrangler.toml under [vars].
# Secrets are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>` and never stored here:
#
#   npx wrangler secret put GLM_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put ORACLE_PRIVATE_KEY
#
# Optional secret for IPFS pinning instead of R2:
#   npx wrangler secret put PINATA_JWT
#
# Deploy: npx wrangler deploy
# Local:  npx wrangler dev
